PepGraphormer applies information from two distinct modules. The ESM2 module leverages the powerful semantic understanding of the language model to capture global sequence features, while the GAT module supplements local structural features by aggregating neighborhood information via the graph structure. The final prediction is a linear interpolation of the probabilistic outputs from the ESM2-based classifier (\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
